1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,233
From now on, leave whenever you want.
No need to ask me.

2
00:00:06,966 --> 00:00:10,166
The lockdown is over.
I gave the order to lock the doors.

3
00:00:11,766 --> 00:00:15,166
Opened the bag once to charge your phone.
The time is on the sheet. I'm sorry.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,433
I'll check it myself. Don't touch it.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,133
When it was taken, who gave the order—
write it all down clearly.

6
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:30,433
It's all there. Keep this copy.
If anything's wrong, come straight to me.

7
00:00:31,933 --> 00:00:34,733
These were mine to begin with.
Don't expect a thank-you.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,300
I know.
You have every right not to forgive me.

9
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,333
But what about everything I suffered?

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:42,833
Ah Tan, I have to go.

11
00:00:45,433 --> 00:00:46,566
Let me drive you back to town, okay?

12
00:00:47,033 --> 00:00:47,866
Just to drop you off.

13
00:00:56,033 --> 00:00:57,900
No. Let me make this trip on my own.

14
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:02,600
I won't say where I'm going.
I just want to be alone for a while.

15
00:01:03,966 --> 00:01:06,500
Okay. I won't follow.
Take care of yourself.

16
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:10,133
Ah Tan, whether we meet again...
I need to figure that out for myself.
